    // User follow-up: "remove canvas all together and you will have the images but you will have the checkered transparent layer as well showing so that needs to be blended" — addressed by removing canvas; transparency composites over dark bg automatically.
    // LATEST TEST: dragon perfect but tad faint; lady perfect but checkered bg showing.
